// audit-conditional-access-changes.kql — [date run: YYYY-MM-DD] — Analyst: [initials]
//
// Result: [ ] No Conditional Access policy creation, modification, or deletion detected in the review window
//         [ ] Results found — see findings below
//
// Findings:
//   Initiating account:
//   Policy name:
//   Change type (add / update / delete):
//   Timeframe:
//   Notes:
//
// Conclusion:
//   [ ] No suspicious activity identified — CA policy change confirmed as an approved change (e.g. change ticket, planned rollout)
//   [ ] Suspicious activity identified — escalating
//   [ ] False positive — reason:
